  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nFears to Fathom is an episodic psychological horror game where each episode unveils a short story narrated by the ones who survived.<p></p>\n<p>You’re browsing the fifth installment of the Fears to Fathom anthology.</p>\n<p>In the fifth episode of Fears to Fathom you play as Sydney Harper, a 23-year-old working at a consulting firm plans a weekend getaway to a rental in Woodbury with her college friends. Little did they know what was about to unfold during their stay. Sydney survived as she made the right choices.</p>\n<p>This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, driving, fishing and conversation mechanics.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Atmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics\n</li><li>VHS film aesthetic\n</li><li>Fishing mechanic\n</li><li>Receive texts from NPCs\n</li><li>Player voice activity\n</li></ul>\n",
